text:
@DrLoupis The Statue of Liberty is in NY Harbor, fed by the Hudson River.
The Hudson is a tidal estuary, where salt water from the ocean combines with fresh water.
During a single day  you can make a photo of Liberty island with water level difference of 2 meters! https://t.co/TrbSwoFJVi

